    <briefdescription>
<para>Default no-op implementation that never encrypts anything. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Suitable for development environments or when field-level encryption is not required. All values are returned unchanged by both <ref refid="classthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_no_op_metadata_encryption_provider_1a89a58ea489a5e503a2a53fa07ebae6ec" kindref="member">encrypt()</ref> and <ref refid="classthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_no_op_metadata_encryption_provider_1aed717a6a7ca2a4b83bd36ead973afd11" kindref="member">decrypt()</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
